        CMOS settings for the B.O.S. are as follows :-

        Base Memory             -       1024K
        Extended Memory         -       384K
        Video Type              -       MDA
        Number of Floppies      -       2
        Diskette Drives         -       Primary   = 1.44M
                                        Secondary = NONE
        Fixed Disks             -       Primary   = TYPE 17
                                        Secondary = NONE

        CMOS settings for the C.T. are as follows :-

        Base Memory             -       1024K
        Extended Memory         -       384K
        Video Type              -       MDA
        Number of Floppies      -       2
        Diskette Drives         -       Primary   = 1.44M
                                        Secondary = NONE
        Fixed Disks             -       Primary   = NONE
                                        Secondary = NONE


        All other CMOS information is Standard AT and is therefore
        available in any AT technical reference.



